# Private keys never enter a build context. Only test/certs/ca.pem — the
# public certificate — belongs in the bicchierino image, and it is copied in
# explicitly so the client can verify grappa's chain. The keys are also
# unreadable to the build: gen-tls.sh runs as root in a container and leaves
# them 600, so a context including them fails outright.
test/certs/*.key
test/certs/*.srl

# Machine-local state, and the submodules' own histories.
test/runtime/
test/grappa/.git/
test/azzurra-testnet/.git/
.git/

*.o
bicchierino
